(7678396, 1255770, 3306, '<td valign="top">I have done something similar. Early on in Covid I was sterilizing everything because we didnt know the mode of transmission. I decided to sterilize some mail before opening by putting it in the microwave. Luckily I smelled them burning. They did not catch fire but were browned a bit!!</td>', 'I have done something similar. Early on in Covid I was sterilizing everything because we didnt know the mode of transmission. I decided to sterilize some mail before opening by putting it in the microwave. Luckily I smelled them burning. They did not catch fire but were browned a bit!!', '2020-11-01 07:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
